abstract: >
  PysternBlot is a GPLv3 Python GUI application for building
  publication-ready Western blot panels with hierarchical
  lane annotations. It supports ECL and NIR fluorescence
  imaging modalities and provides tools for image adjustment,
  cropping, rotation, and multi-channel TIFF handling.
  Version 1.0.4 adds a live pixel-intensity histogram with
  draggable gate lines, gamma-adjustment integrity flagging
  per journal guidelines, asymmetric legend grouping via
  per-cell group numbers, Typhoon .inf sidecar metadata
  capture in the integrity report, blot display names, a
  saved-dropdown-entries manager, and a dedicated Library tab
  for project navigation.
keywords:
